  "summary": "Senior software engineer / architect with 20 years experience in the design and implementation of complex software systems.\n\nExpertise in object-oriented development, including design for performance, design for reuse, and interface design.  I am proficient in all phases of project management, from customer interface / requirements gathering to managing people and schedules, to getting projects out the door on time and with good quality. \n\nI have a strong commitment to customer satisfaction - I seek to understand and satisfy what the customer needs are. I am also committed to releasing well-tested software with good quality.\n\nI am experienced in project leadership / management with projects of up to 15 people.\n\nSpecialties: C++, C, XML, Python\nObject Oriented Programming\nVisual Studio \nUnix / Linux / Windows\nElectronic design automation\nGraphics programming - DirectX 10, DirectSound\nGraphics tools / formats - Pix for DirectX; Autodesk Max, including Max SDK; Autodesk Maya, including Maya SDK; FBX",
