    "description": "Infrastructure architect for immersive, physics-based Virtual World startup. As such, I was responsible for the graphical viewer based on DirectX10, the 3D audio subsystem (using Direct3D sound), Direct3D 10 HLSL shader implementations, and debugging and resolution of rendering problems. I also designed and implemented 3D model translators from 3DS Max and Maya to Xulu’s proprietary graphics database, using the Max SDK and the Maya SDK, respectively. \nIn addition, I implemented several real-time dynamics physical actors built on top of the real-time physics simulator.",
